  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖主机冷却水系统集控室监测要求，明确应显示的关键参数及报警功能。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="1">
    <Requirement id="ER-P011-01-01" level="1" requirementType="alarm">
      <sysml:Name>集控室参数监测</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>集控室监测系统应具备参数超限报警功能，报警应接入船舶报警管理系统，并在机控室和驾驶台显示。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P011" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-ISO8861-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>参数超限时无法及时报警，可能导致设备损坏或安全事故。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查报警设定值清单，确认HT出机高温、进机低压、LT出冷却器高温、膨胀水箱低液位等报警点已设置。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟超限工况，验证报警信号在集控室、机控室和驾驶台正确触发。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【集控室参数监测】，来自原始需求「集控室应能清楚显示冷却水温度、压力、液位、泵运行状态等关键参数」。E-CTRL-COOL-002（IACS UR E10）支撑了报警接入机控室和驾驶台的要求；E-ISO8861-002（ISO 8861:1998）支撑了报警应在机控室和驾驶台显示。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
